                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__item-8__qstr-1__para-i">
                <num>i</num>
                <content>
                  <p>land at a time when it is Territory Land; or</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__item-8__qstr-1__para-ii">
                <num>ii</num>
                <content>
