      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-3">
          <num>3</num>
          <heading>Canberra Water Supply (Googong Dam) Act 1974</heading>
          <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-3__item-1">
            <num>1</num>
            <heading>Section 4 (after the heading)</heading>
            <content>
              <p>Insert:</p>
            </content>
            <quotedStructure eId="schedule-3__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
              <subsection eId="schedule-3__item-1__qstr-1__subsec-1">
                <num>1</num>
                <content>
                  <p>	(1)	The Executive, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has the functions of managing, protecting and using the water resources of the Googong Dam Area in a way that is consistent with the objects of the <i>Water Resources Act 2007</i> (ACT).</p>
                </content>
              </subsection>
            </quotedStructure>
          </hcontainer>
